("These certificates are issued by IATA or ICAO, not by the School. They are recorded here when the School receives them.","Ces certificats sont délivrés par l'IATA ou l'OACI, non par l'école. Ils sont enregistrés ici à leur réception.","Ibi byemezo bitangwa na IATA cyangwa ICAO, si ishuri. Byandikwa hano iyo ishuri ribyakiriye.","Vyeti hivi hutolewa na IATA au ICAO, si shule. Hurekodiwa hapa shule inapovipokea."),("Issued by","Délivré par","Cyatanzwe na","Kimetolewa na"),("Issued","Délivré le","Cyatanzwe ku wa","Kimetolewa"),("Exam","Examen","Ikizamini","Mtihani"),("Revoke","Révoquer","Hagarika","Batilisha"),("Reissue","Réémettre","Ongera utange","Toa upya"),("replaces","remplace","gisimbura","kinachukua nafasi ya"),("None recorded yet.","Aucun enregistré.","Nta na kimwe kiranditswe.","Bado hakuna kilichorekodiwa."),
